<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:28,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:28,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:33,610 --> 00:01:34,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to keep you waiting.</font>

32
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Morino Ibiki, proctor for
the first test of the Chunin Exam.</font>

33
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, from Hidden Sound Village!</font>

34
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:51,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No doing as you please
before the Exam!</font>

35
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want to be failed
at the get go?!</font>

36
00:01:56,590 --> 00:02:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry. It's our first time taking the Exams,
so we flipped out... despite ourselves.</font>

37
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph.This is a good opportunity,
so I'll say this.</font>

38
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There will be no battles,
competitions and the like</font>

39
00:02:09,350 --> 00:02:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without the permission
of the proctors!</font>

40
00:02:11,690 --> 00:02:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And even if you get permission,</font>

41
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:16,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">actions that could lead to the death
of an opponent will not be permitted.</font>

42
00:02:17,610 --> 00:02:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Any pig that screws with me
will be disqualified immediately.</font>

43
00:02:21,780 --> 00:02:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it?!</font>

44
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Exam looks to be easy!</font>

45
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:36,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, we will start
the first test of the Chunin Exam!</font>

46
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Turn in your applications,</font>

47
00:02:38,930 --> 00:02:41,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">take one of these number cards
in exchange,</font>

48
00:02:41,510 --> 00:02:43,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and sit in the seat
matching that number!</font>

49
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After that, we will hand out
the paper for the written test!</font>

50
00:02:47,730 --> 00:02:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Written...? Paper...?</font>

51
00:02:51,270 --> 00:02:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Paper...</font>

52
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A paper test?!</font>

53
00:02:59,490 --> 00:03:05,450
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">One Fail Already?</font>

54
00:02:59,490 --> 00:03:05,450
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Extremely Difficult
First Exam</font>

55
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's seats are all scattered...
What should I do?</font>

56
00:03:23,930 --> 00:03:25,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's deflated, deflated...</font>

57
00:03:25,890 --> 00:03:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the worst type of test for Naruto...</font>

58
00:03:30,390 --> 00:03:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

59
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! You are Hinata...!
Since when have you...?</font>

60
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:41,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Let's both do our best.</font>

61
00:03:42,110 --> 00:03:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah.</font>

62
00:03:44,870 --> 00:03:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't notice her at all.</font>

63
00:03:47,410 --> 00:03:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata has no presence at all...</font>

64
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are several important
rules to this first test.</font>

65
00:03:57,880 --> 00:04:02,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take no questions,
so listen well accordingly!</font>

66
00:04:03,010 --> 00:04:05,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rules? No questions will be taken...?</font>

67
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:08,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First off is the first rule!</font>

68
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are given ten points
each from the start!</font>

69
00:04:13,730 --> 00:04:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The written test has
ten problems in all!</font>

70
00:04:15,980 --> 00:04:17,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Each problem is one point.</font>

71
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, this test is a
point deduction system.</font>

72
00:04:21,650 --> 00:04:24,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are deducted one point for
each problem you get wrong!</font>

73
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you get three wrong,
you'll have seven points!</font>

74
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I get ten wrong,
I'll have zero points...</font>

75
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The second rule.</font>

76
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pass or failure will be determined</font>

77
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by the total points of
the three-person teams.</font>

78
00:04:44,090 --> 00:04:45,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait a minute!</font>

79
00:04:46,090 --> 00:04:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean...
total points of the teams?</font>

80
00:04:49,060 --> 00:04:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

81
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:52,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a perfectly
good reason for this!</font>

82
00:04:52,270 --> 00:04:53,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up and listen!</font>

83
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:55,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reason...?</font>

84
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you've got it,
here is the most important next rule!</font>

85
00:04:58,190 --> 00:05:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who are deemed by
the sentinels</font>

86
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:04,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as having committed an act of
cheating or something similar to that...</font>

87
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:10,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will have two points deducted
for each act.</font>

88
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What...?
— Oh!</font>

89
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...</font>

90
00:05:13,790 --> 00:05:17,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there may be those who will be
dismissed during this test</font>

91
00:05:17,330 --> 00:05:20,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without waiting for test grading.</font>

92
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This means they're deducting points</font>

93
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from things other
than the written test problems.</font>

94
00:05:27,970 --> 00:05:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Know that those who
commit awkward cheating...</font>

95
00:05:31,180 --> 00:05:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will bring ruin upon yourselves.</font>

96
00:05:33,890 --> 00:05:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll check you anytime.</font>

97
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you aspire to become
a Chunin at all,</font>

98
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">know that Shinobi should act
like exemplary Shinobi.</font>

99
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:48,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Relax...!
Yes... yes!</font>

100
00:05:48,740 --> 00:05:52,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto aside,
Sasuke-kun and I are okay!</font>

101
00:05:52,490 --> 00:05:56,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if Naruto gets zero points...
if we cover that...</font>

102
00:05:56,750 --> 00:06:01,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, in the case of even one person
on the team getting zero points...</font>

103
00:06:01,590 --> 00:06:04,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone on that team will fail!</font>

104
00:06:04,710 --> 00:06:05,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

105
00:06:05,420 --> 00:06:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did he say...?!</font>

106
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:11,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel two menacing stares...</font>

107
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:13,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun?</font>

108
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:17,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, the last problem will
be given forty-five minutes</font>

109
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after the start of the test!</font>

110
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:21,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time for the test is one hour.</font>

111
00:06:25,610 --> 00:06:26,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin!</font>

112
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:36,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it...</font>

113
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:38,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that,
the fat is really on the fire now...?</font>

114
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!
Just don't get zero points!</font>

115
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:49,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto isn't getting jitters
from the get go, is he...?</font>

116
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:51,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad...</font>

117
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As if!</font>

118
00:06:57,180 --> 00:07:01,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know I've cleared many obstacles
like this before...</font>

119
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:03,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At times like this, one should
look at all the problems</font>

120
00:07:03,650 --> 00:07:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without feeling pressed
or making a fuss!</font>

121
00:07:05,230 --> 00:07:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then with utmost effort</font>

122
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:09,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should tackle the problems that look
easy to understand!</font>

123
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see, the first problem...
is a code text, eh...</font>

124
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:16,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellent, I say!</font>

125
00:07:18,620 --> 00:07:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next! Next!</font>

126
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see... the second problem...</font>

127
00:07:22,290 --> 00:07:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The parabola B in the diagram illustrates
the greatest possible distance</font>

128
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:31,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enemy Ninja A can throw his Shuriken
from a tree seven meters high...</font>

129
00:07:32,510 --> 00:07:34,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Predict and answer the Enemy Ninja's
character inferred</font>

130
00:07:35,050 --> 00:07:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the ellipse this Shuriken forms,</font>

131
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:41,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">also answer the longest firing range
in battle on flat ground</font>

132
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and explain your basis.</font>

133
00:07:45,150 --> 00:07:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This is an... integrated problem based
on predictions</font>

134
00:07:48,990 --> 00:07:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of uncertain conditions and
dynamic energy analysis application...!</font>

135
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way
Naruto can solve this!</font>

136
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:57,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean...</font>

137
00:07:57,700 --> 00:08:01,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">hardly anyone except me
can solve this problem!</font>

138
00:08:04,710 --> 00:08:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, next!
Next!</font>

139
00:08:11,220 --> 00:08:13,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These other problems...
are nothing but difficult ones.</font>

140
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

141
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:28,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't... understand even
one of these problems.</font>

142
00:08:32,530 --> 00:08:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no, this is bad!</font>

143
00:08:34,410 --> 00:08:35,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For real! For real!</font>

144
00:08:35,950 --> 00:08:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?
What should I do? What should I do?</font>

145
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:52,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If about ten of all fifty-one teams
are able to pass,</font>

146
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will be bad if I didn't stretch myself and
get a considerable amount of points.</font>

147
00:08:57,260 --> 00:08:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like a system inviting cheating...</font>

148
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:04,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope Sasuke-kun and Naruto
won't panic and cheat.</font>

149
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay...
Naruto's not that much of an idiot...</font>

150
00:09:10,230 --> 00:09:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that...</font>

151
00:09:14,990 --> 00:09:15,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't panic...</font>

152
00:09:15,990 --> 00:09:19,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For now, all there is to do is to be
very, very cautious...</font>

153
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and cheat without being found out!</font>

154
00:09:26,710 --> 00:09:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! No! I can't, that's no good,
no good!</font>

155
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't tread on such thin ice!</font>

156
00:09:33,010 --> 00:09:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate, this elaborate fuss...</font>

157
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like a trick assuming
that we're going to cheat.</font>

158
00:09:40,350 --> 00:09:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They probably check with that paper...</font>

159
00:09:45,810 --> 00:09:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody got nailed.</font>

160
00:09:48,230 --> 00:09:50,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cheating deducts two points.</font>

161
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two-point deduction, huh...</font>

162
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ordinarily, it'd be failure the moment
the cheating was discovered...</font>

163
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Know that those who
commit awkward cheating</font>

164
00:10:10,290 --> 00:10:12,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will bring ruin upon themselves.</font>

165
00:10:13,250 --> 00:10:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi should act like exemplary Shinobi.</font>

166
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, so that's how it is, eh.</font>

167
00:10:21,050 --> 00:10:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This wasn't just an achievement test!</font>

168
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:25,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real aim was...</font>

169
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:29,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a test to see the ability
for intensive information collection</font>

170
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the full use of deception
and concealment techniques.</font>

171
00:10:35,650 --> 00:10:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Shinobi should read
"the double bluff," eh...</font>

172
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, the true intention
of the proctor is...</font>

173
00:10:40,950 --> 00:10:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you're going to cheat,
not "awkward cheating,"</font>

174
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but "like exemplary Shinobi",
don't get caught.</font>

175
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Viewed in this light, the extra-ordinariness
of the point deduction system,</font>

176
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the lenience of only deducting two points
for each discovery of cheating makes sense.</font>

177
00:10:59,630 --> 00:11:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

178
00:11:00,930 --> 00:11:04,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what's being tested here is how
we can gather the correct answers</font>

179
00:11:04,180 --> 00:11:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without having our cheating detected
by the proctors or</font>

180
00:11:07,930 --> 00:11:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by the one being cheated on.</font>

181
00:11:11,690 --> 00:11:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Realize it quick, Naruto!</font>

182
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll turn into a fatal mistake!</font>

183
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Realize it!</font>

184
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad.</font>

185
00:11:28,370 --> 00:11:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the purpose of this test is seeing
the ability to gather information...</font>

186
00:11:35,130 --> 00:11:38,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then there should be someone
in this classroom somewhere...</font>

187
00:11:39,090 --> 00:11:41,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who knows the answers
to the problems!</font>

188
00:11:46,970 --> 00:11:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Gaara has also started, eh...</font>

189
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:52,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph... I'm counting on you, Crow.</font>

190
00:12:05,700 --> 00:12:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo, good boy, Akamaru!
Next is problem four!</font>

191
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:24,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Judging from this rhythm...</font>

192
00:12:24,470 --> 00:12:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The stroke order...
and the number of strokes...</font>

193
00:12:29,270 --> 00:12:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

194
00:12:47,070 --> 00:12:48,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Please tell me.</font>

195
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eight, huh.</font>

196
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:08,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, if you can see it,
wear your headband!</font>

197
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Time is rapidly going by!</font>

198
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:34,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, man! I'm afraid all there
is to do is cheat...</font>

199
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:37,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, if I'm discovered,</font>

200
00:13:37,580 --> 00:13:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it'll be trouble for Sakura-chan
and Sasuke.</font>

201
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the other hand,
if I get zero points...</font>

202
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:46,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan and Sasuke will be
my companions in failure.</font>

203
00:13:47,970 --> 00:13:48,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

204
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:55,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll show you... my test.</font>

205
00:13:55,980 --> 00:13:56,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

206
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is Hinata saying...?</font>

207
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why would she do
such a thing for me?</font>

208
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be... some kind of trickery?</font>

209
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Hinata is not one to do
something like that...</font>

210
00:14:16,330 --> 00:14:20,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... But she might've been coaxed into
attempting to trap me by Kiba and others...</font>

211
00:14:21,170 --> 00:14:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, let me ask you one thing!</font>

212
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:24,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

213
00:14:24,710 --> 00:14:26,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would you show me?</font>

214
00:14:31,100 --> 00:14:32,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... uh... actually...</font>

215
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I...</font>

216
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:47,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want you, Naruto-kun...
to leave at this stage...</font>

217
00:14:52,950 --> 00:14:56,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You see...
the nine of us are the only rookies...</font>

218
00:14:56,660 --> 00:14:59,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I have many anxieties about
what's to come, so!</font>

219
00:15:02,250 --> 00:15:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it now! I was kind of
strangely suspicious of you!</font>

220
00:15:10,050 --> 00:15:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyhow! This is crazy lucky!</font>

221
00:15:13,850 --> 00:15:15,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness I'm next to Hinata...</font>

222
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:30,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What was that?
I was about to turn...</font>

223
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What was that for, sir?!</font>

224
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:40,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You made five mistakes. You fail!</font>

225
00:15:41,170 --> 00:15:42,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way...</font>

226
00:15:43,170 --> 00:15:47,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His two buddies, both of you get out
of the classroom, right now.</font>

227
00:16:00,270 --> 00:16:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">#23 fails!</font>

228
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">#43 and #27 fail!</font>

229
00:16:04,650 --> 00:16:06,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

230
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey! Do you have proof that
I cheated five whole times?!</font>

231
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:18,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, are you guys properly checking
this number of people...?</font>

232
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up...</font>

233
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even among us Chunin, we're elite
who were selected for this Exam.</font>

234
00:16:28,920 --> 00:16:32,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't overlook you blinking once...</font>

235
00:16:32,510 --> 00:16:35,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a matter of speaking,
this strength is the proof.</font>

236
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:41,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...?</font>

237
00:16:43,810 --> 00:16:45,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry... Look...</font>

238
00:17:04,870 --> 00:17:08,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata... You don't get it, do you?</font>

239
00:17:09,130 --> 00:17:09,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

240
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:14,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An awesome ninja like me
won't cheat.</font>

241
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto-kun.</font>

242
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

243
00:17:24,020 --> 00:17:25,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, if something went wrong,</font>

244
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:29,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'd be in a hot spot for
helping me cheat, right?!</font>

245
00:17:29,940 --> 00:17:30,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

246
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:32,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

247
00:17:36,110 --> 00:17:39,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... sorry...
I-I did something uncalled for...</font>

248
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nah, it's okay.</font>

249
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... went and acted big.</font>

250
00:17:47,870 --> 00:17:51,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?
I'm extremely stupid.</font>

251
00:17:57,180 --> 00:17:58,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

252
00:18:01,050 --> 00:18:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

253
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll copy all his movements!</font>

254
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My hand is moving fluently...</font>

255
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:11,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hit the jackpot straight away
with this guy.</font>

256
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, it looks like you're done, eh.</font>

257
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:20,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm acknowledging that your smarts</font>

258
00:18:20,450 --> 00:18:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the width of your forehead
are exceptional.</font>

259
00:18:23,910 --> 00:18:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you should thank me.</font>

260
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank me for getting to be
the target for this Jutsu.</font>

261
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:31,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Mind Transfer Jutsu!</font>

262
00:18:38,630 --> 00:18:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Ino... started using that Jutsu...</font>

263
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no countering that spell of Ino's...</font>

264
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, I let myself move
into your mind for just a little bit.</font>

265
00:18:56,230 --> 00:18:58,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to memorize the answers quick.</font>

266
00:18:58,610 --> 00:19:01,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to pass these answers
to Shikamaru and Choji.</font>

267
00:19:02,490 --> 00:19:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">#59! Fails!</font>

268
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">#33! #9!</font>

269
00:19:07,950 --> 00:19:09,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the thirteenth group to fail.</font>

270
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:13,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">#41 fails.</font>

271
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:16,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">#35, #62 fails!</font>

272
00:19:16,710 --> 00:19:17,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

273
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:22,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That brat...</font>

274
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He coolly proceeds through this
ruckus without moving an eyelash.</font>

275
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very well done considering he's new.</font>

276
00:19:43,820 --> 00:19:46,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The optic nerves are connected...</font>

277
00:19:46,740 --> 00:19:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The third eye... open!</font>

278
00:20:05,180 --> 00:20:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ugh! There's dirt in my eye...</font>

279
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...!</font>

280
00:20:25,570 --> 00:20:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me.</font>

281
00:20:26,990 --> 00:20:27,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

282
00:20:28,370 --> 00:20:30,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to go to the bathroom...</font>

283
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will accompany you
to the bathroom.</font>

284
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:36,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

285
00:20:42,590 --> 00:20:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyhow... the proctors are
nothing so special!</font>

286
00:20:48,390 --> 00:20:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They don't realize that the proctors
have increased by one...</font>

287
00:20:52,060 --> 00:20:54,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eh, don't you think so...</font>

288
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:55,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crow...?</font>

289
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:03,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forty minutes have passed
since the test started...</font>

290
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:05,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Twenty minutes left... huh...</font>

291
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this,</font>

292
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's the last problem to be given
forty-five minutes after the start of the test.</font>

293
00:21:15,210 --> 00:21:17,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All there is to do is bet on this.</font>

294
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:36,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

295
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

296
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

297
00:21:43,410 --> 00:21:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

298
00:21:50,590 --> 00:21:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

